      "content": "hey so i had my abdominal surgery about 5 days ago and ive been feeling kinda crappy. my stomach is hurting more today than it was yesterday and i feel like i have a bit of a fever too. also when i press on my belly it feels really hard/stiff instead of soft like it usually is. is this just part of the healing thing? i dont really want to go back to the hospital if i dont have to",
